ality Food (SQF) food safety standards. SQF is benchmarked against the Global Food Safety Initiative (GFSI), the gold standard for food safety.</p>", "icon": {"alt": "", "loading": "lazy", "src": ""}, "title": "SQF Food Safety"}, {"content": "<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Certified to NSF's GMP standard 455-2 for dietary supplements. Independent third-party audit of Good Manufacturing Practices specifically for the supplement category.</p>", "icon": {"alt": "", "loading": "lazy", "src": ""}, "title": "NSF GMP 455-2"}], "css_class": "dnd-module", "gap": 28, "header_width": 1100, "headline_lh": "1.25", "headline_size": 32, "max_width": 1100, "min_column_width": 260, "module_id": 218940115759, "section_eyebrow": "", "section_headline": "", "section_subhead": "", "style": {"background_color": {"color": "#F7F7F6", "opacity": 100}, "padding": {"padding_bottom": 70, "padding_top": 20}}, "subhead_size": 17, "subhead_width": 0, "text_color": "dark", "title_lh": "normal", "title_size": 19, "title_style": "heading"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "column_3", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "module_3", "name": "module_3", "params": {"align": "center", "css_class": "dnd-module", "eyebrow": "", "headline": "", "headline_size": 34, "logo_gap": 60, "logos": [{"image": {"alt": "SQF Certified", "loading": "lazy", "src": "https://info.davincilabs.com/hubfs/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png"}, "max_height": 80}, {"image": {"alt": "NSF GMP Certified", "loading": "lazy", "src": "https://info.davincilabs.com/hubfs/private-label/NSF.png"}, "max_height": 80}], "max_width": 1100, "module_id": 218940115771, "style": {"background_color": {"color": "#FFFFFF", "opacity": 100}, "padding": {"padding_bottom": 60, "padding_top": 60}}, "subhead": "", "text_color": "dark"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "column_4", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "module_4", "name": "module_4", "params": {"button_padding": "16px 40px", "button_size": 16, "buttons": [{"link": {"open_in_new_tab": false, "url": {"href": "#get-started", "type": "EXTERNAL"}}, "style": "primary", "text": "Schedule a Consultation"}], "content": "<p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55\">Schedule a consultation. We will walk through your audience, the right formulations for them, branding options, and the timeline.</p>", "content_color": {"color": "#333333", "opacity": 100}, "content_size": 17, "css_class": "dnd-module", "eyebrow": "", "headline": "Ready to launch your private label supplement line?", "headline_lh": "1.25", "headline_size": 32, "max_width": 720, "module_id": 218940115731, "style": {"background_color": {"color": "#E6E5E3", "opacity": 100}, "padding": {"padding_bottom": 80, "padding_top": 80}}, "text_color": "dark"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "column_5", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "module_5", "name": "module_5", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-module", "module_id": 218944099153}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "column_6", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "module_6", "name": "module_6", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-module", "module_id": 218944099156}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "column_7", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "module_7", "name": "module_7", "params": {"answer_size": 15, "css_class": "dnd-module", "headline_lh": "normal", "headline_size": 32, "items": [{"answer": "No. The FDA does not approve dietary supplements before they go to market. FDA-registered means we are on the FDA's list of facilities that manufacture dietary supplements, which requires meeting facility and process standards. No supplement manufacturer can legally claim FDA approval.", "question": "Is FDA-registered the same as FDA-approved?"}, {"answer": "GMP (Good Manufacturing Practice) certification means an independent third-party auditor has confirmed we follow defined quality protocols for facility, equipment, personnel, raw materials, processes, packaging, and record-keeping. GMP is the baseline retailers and serious customers look for. NSF GMP 455-2 is the most rigorous supplement-specific GMP standard.", "question": "What does GMP certified mean and why does it matter?"}, {"answer": "Depends on your audience. NSF Certified for Sport matters for athletic brands. Informed Sport / Informed Choice matters for professional sports. Non-GMO Project Verified matters for clean-label audiences. USP Verified is a premium pharmaceutical-grade certification. We discuss which apply to your positioning during onboarding.", "question": "Are there other certifications I should look for as a brand owner?"}, {"answer": "Some SKUs and ingredients are USDA Organic certified. Full organic certification depends on the formulation. We tell you per-SKU whether organic certification is possible during your consultation.", "question": "Can my products be certified organic?"}, {"answer": "Some SKUs are kosher and/or halal certified. Both certifications require specific ingredient sourcing and facility protocols. We have certified manufacturing lines available for kosher and halal products. Specific SKU availability varies.", "question": "Do you support kosher and halal certifications?"}], "max_width": 820, "module_id": 218940115739, "open_first": false, "question_size": 17, "section_eyebrow": "", "section_headline": "Frequently asked questions", "section_subhead": "<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; line-height: 27px\">None</p>", "style": {"background_color": {"color": "#F7F7F6", "opacity": 100}, "padding": {"padding_bottom": 80, "padding_top": 80}}, "text_color": "dark"}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}, {"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "name": "column_8", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-column"}, "rowMetaData": [{"cssClass": "dnd-row"}], "rows": [{"0": {"cells": [], "cssClass": "", "cssId": "", "cssStyle": "", "label": "module_8", "name": "module_8", "params": {"css_class": "dnd-module", "module_id": 218942529652}, "rowMetaData": [], "rows": [], "type": "module", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}], "type": "cell", "w": 0, "x": 0}}